   "source": [
    "# ACI Pro-Forma Workbench — Project 1\n",
    "\n",
    "**Decision supported:** should the fund *initiate*, *watch/defer*, or *not initiate* a position in Albertsons Companies, Inc. (NYSE: ACI)?\n",
    "**User:** the fund's investment committee (no current position). **Horizon:** through the FY2026 Q4 call and turnaround plan (spring 2027).\n",
    "**Valuation date / bridge balance sheet:** Sept 12, 2026 (Q2 FY2026). **Units:** USD millions except per share. **Share basis:** 488.2m diluted (Q2 FY2026).\n",
    "\n",
    "How to use: run all cells. The **driver panel** (cell 3) moves bounded drivers; **Reset to base** restores them. The **checks panel** turns red when an input combination breaks the model or leaves the historical band. Every number is computed by `analysis.py`; this notebook only displays it.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "230db418",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import json\n",
    "from dataclasses import replace, asdict\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import analysis as A\n",
    "\n",
    "pd.options.display.float_format = \"{:,.1f}\".format\n",
    "BASE_RESULT = A.run(A.BASE)\n",
    "BASE_VALUE = BASE_RESULT[\"valuation\"][\"value_per_share\"]\n",
    "print(f\"Engine loaded. Base value per share: ${BASE_VALUE:.2f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ceedbf29",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Driver panel (semi-adjustable: drivers exposed, engine and checks locked)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7549ff36",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import ipywidgets as w\n",
    "from IPython.display import display, HTML\n",
    "\n",
    "LABELS = {\"growth_fy2026\": \"Revenue growth FY26\", \"growth_long\": \"Revenue growth FY28-30\",\n",
    "          \"gross_margin_fy2026\": \"Gross margin FY26\", \"gross_margin_long\": \"Gross margin FY30\",\n",
    "          \"sga_to_gp_fy2026\": \"SG&A / gross profit FY26\", \"sga_to_gp_long\": \"SG&A / gross profit FY30\",\n",
    "          \"capex\": \"Capex ($m / yr)\", \"wacc\": \"WACC\", \"terminal_growth\": \"Terminal growth\"}\n",
    "sliders = {}\n",
    "for k, (lo, hi, blo, bhi, unit, basis) in A.BOUNDS.items():\n",
    "    step = 10.0 if unit == \"$m\" else 0.0005\n",
    "    fmt = \".0f\" if unit == \"$m\" else \".2%\"\n",
    "    sliders[k] = w.FloatSlider(value=getattr(A.BASE, k), min=lo, max=hi, step=step, readout_format=fmt,\n",
    "                               description=LABELS[k], style={\"description_width\": \"190px\"},\n",
    "                               layout=w.Layout(width=\"520px\"), continuous_update=False,\n",
    "                               tooltip=basis)\n",
    "reset = w.Button(description=\"Reset to base\", button_style=\"info\")\n",
    "out = w.Output()\n",
    "\n",
    "def render(*_):\n",
    "    d = replace(A.BASE, **{k: s.value for k, s in sliders.items()})\n",
    "    with out:\n",
    "        out.clear_output(wait=True)\n",
    "        try:\n",
    "            r = A.run(d)\n",
    "        except Exception as e:  # engine refuses incoherent inputs loudly\n",
    "            display(HTML(f\"<div style='background:#fbeae0;color:#a4400f;padding:8px'><b>MODEL REFUSED INPUT:</b> {e}</div>\"))\n",
    "            return\n",
    "        v, s = r[\"valuation\"], r[\"statements\"]\n",
    "        rows = []\n",
    "        for name, ok, detail in r[\"checks\"]:\n",
    "            color = \"#1f6b4f\" if ok else \"#c0392b\"\n",
    "            rows.append(f\"<tr><td style='color:{color};font-weight:700'>{'PASS' if ok else 'FAIL'}</td><td>{name}</td><td>{detail}</td></tr>\")\n",
    "        n_fail = sum(not ok for _, ok, _ in r[\"checks\"])\n",
    "        banner = (\"<div style='background:#c0392b;color:white;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700'>\"\n",
    "                  f\"{n_fail} CHECK(S) FAILING — this input combination is outside what the model can defend</div>\") if n_fail else \"\"\n",
    "        if v:\n",
    "            delta = v[\"value_per_share\"] - BASE_VALUE\n",
    "            display(HTML(f\"{banner}<h3 style='margin:6px 0'>Value per share ${v['value_per_share']:.2f} \"\n",
    "                         f\"<span style='font-weight:400'>({delta:+.2f} vs base ${BASE_VALUE:.2f})</span></h3>\"\n",
    "                         f\"EV ${v['enterprise_value']:,.0f}m − debt ${v['debt']:,.0f}m + cash ${v['cash']:,.0f}m = equity ${v['equity_value']:,.0f}m \"\n",
    "                         f\"÷ {v['shares']:.1f}m shares · terminal value {v['terminal_share']:.1%} of EV\"))\n",
    "        table = pd.DataFrame({f\"FY{y}E\": {k: s[y][k] for k in (\"revenue\", \"ebitda\", \"ebit\", \"net_income\", \"fcff\", \"cash\", \"bs_gap\")} for y in A.YEARS})\n",
    "        display(table)\n",
    "        display(HTML(\"<table>\" + \"\".join(rows) + \"</table>\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "def do_reset(_):\n",
    "    for k, s in sliders.items():\n",
    "        s.value = getattr(A.BASE, k)\n",
    "    render()\n",
    "\n",
    "for s in sliders.values():\n",
    "    s.observe(render, names=\"value\")\n",
    "reset.on_click(do_reset)\n",
    "display(w.VBox([w.HBox([reset]), *sliders.values(), out]))\n",
    "render()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "347c125f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Frozen base-case output (visible without running)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "b9c9ebec",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "r = BASE_RESULT\n",
    "s, v = r[\"statements\"], r[\"valuation\"]\n",
    "lines = [\"revenue\",\"gross_profit\",\"sga\",\"ebitda\",\"ebit\",\"interest\",\"net_income\",\n",
    "         \"inventory\",\"accounts_payable\",\"ppe\",\"cash\",\"debt\",\"equity\",\"total_assets\",\"bs_gap\",\n",
    "         \"cfo\",\"cfi\",\"cff\",\"net_change_in_cash\",\"nopat\",\"da\",\"capex\",\"delta_nwc\",\"fcff\",\"fcfe\"]\n",
    "display(pd.DataFrame({f\"FY{y}E\": {k: s[y][k] for k in lines} for y in A.YEARS}))\n",
    "print(f\"EV ${v['enterprise_value']:,.1f}m | equity ${v['equity_value']:,.1f}m | ${v['value_per_share']:.2f}/share | TV share {v['terminal_share']:.1%}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9da940af",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Causal cases, WACC × growth grid, one-at-a-time sensitivity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1df390a7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"Cases ($/share):\")\n",
    "for k, x in A.cases().items():\n",
    "    print(f\"  {k:<42} ${x:6.2f}\")\n",
    "grid = A.wacc_growth_grid()\n",
    "display(pd.DataFrame(grid).T.rename(index=lambda x: f\"WACC {x:.1%}\", columns=lambda x: f\"g {x:.1%}\").style.format(\"${:.2f}\"))\n",
    "display(pd.DataFrame([{\"driver\": t[\"driver\"], \"band\": f\"{t['low']:.4g} to {t['high']:.4g}\",\n",
    "                       \"value at low\": t[\"at_low\"][\"value_per_share\"], \"value at high\": t[\"at_high\"][\"value_per_share\"],\n",
    "                       \"swing $/share\": t[\"swing\"]} for t in A.tornado()]).style.format(\n",
    "    {\"value at low\": \"${:.2f}\", \"value at high\": \"${:.2f}\", \"swing $/share\": \"${:.2f}\"}))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "99c5e6cb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Checks"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "51d30841",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "for n, ok, x in BASE_RESULT[\"checks\"] + A.base_year_reconciliation():\n",
    "    print((\"PASS \" if ok else \"FAIL \") + n + \" — \" + x)"
   ]
  },
  {
